Z||000000||Oreif||06-11-2000||08:05 PM||||Here is some pics of the GT wheels I refinished and put on my car. (pics would have been better if it was sunny today) The tires are 225/50HR15's BFGoodrich Euro T/A's. <BR>A special thanks to Rodney for the center caps!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Oreif1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wheel_4.jpg"> <P>||||reg||6
